{"step_index":231,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:08:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-21T09:08:26+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-21T09:08:29+09:00\nThe search for \"\"신모라공단\" 903호 OR (\"모라동 75-8\" 903호)\" returned the following summary:\n요청하신 \"신모라공단\" 또는 \"모라동 75-8\" 소재지의 903호에 대한 검색 결과는 다음과 같습니다.\n\n검색된 공공 데이터 및 산업체 목록상에서 **'모라동 75-8(신모라공단/모라아파트형공장)'** 건물 내에 903호가 입주해 있다는 구체적인 정보는 확인되지 않습니다.\n\n*   **참고 사항:**\n    *   해당 주소지(부산 사상구 모라동 75-8 일대)는 '신모라공단' 또는 '모라아파트형공장'으로 불리며, 여러 업체가 입주해 있으나 주로 200호~800호대 위주의 사무실 및 공장이 등록되어 있습니다[1][2][3][4][5].\n    *   검색 결과 중 \"903호\"가 포함된 주소는 해당 지역이 아닌 다른 건물(예: 해운대구 센텀아이에스타워, 동구 천일고속빌딩 등)인 경우가 많습니다[1][5].\n\n특정 업체를 찾으시는 경우, 해당 호수에 입주한 기업명이 있거나 검색하시려는 목적을 알려주시면 추가 확인에 도움이 될 수 있습니다.\n\nSources:\n[1] [hankyung.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF6STpoq6V5Tx8nmcIdU8DyTdHgN5rnlNopNoGjnrxUJPdGu6UbEFr5PhhVmnuDHOlNnmeHRVnAuU5gXbFfjxPXYt_FrTTYUxRUHDaJ0luMBe8MuuTviHGAsj3PxIlVntMVisE=)\n[2] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF0KkBYJfEipDVLMYgwU4wEN9EQbj-JQuQNSTlP0VnwCRPO77Xp4wF8MQl2BrRvYz5LG2-_yikaVEGwU9hQIWjF4BQ5xp_q5Wl7VS6yJkEBK8Sm)\n[3] [tipa.or.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE9uLqsvz9ukoZHPUCxTvCvO5_e_REGN0tQNPVBr6DEyBobcBmFNIXSJ2FboV1jrh3FTa3Ph6ZvWZturfuFnxHHYaAytk_1289OJNhdf77y3_EuCX0ZML8ADZEZenNHyWHD)\n[4] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEvixtmWHOTh0Axym32nuZ0Zv0EfOnXObDiVzXfvoAezk9OtIRLE0FMNixPhtK2g5QmQL7bs1CHncJl2lY7hjg2ddN7co_-uMcp-uIQkSupdJdAew==)\n[5] [tistory.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHl5PyfW7js1-Vosh8TtRVXLv1Ih6eLieKrTy1sIIvl_qQXXBvbIU_7Vw9ydyQLQ93Eniw1brehTWVcKxTPBj70Yi9O1ePDljbbuEILDZ90mbFhWA==)"}
{"step_index":232,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:08:33Z","thinking":"The remaining 318 target companies require systematic processing. Determining the match rate of direct searches versus web/maps lookups is crucial. A batch script will be designed to iterate through each company record in `target_318_companies.json`, leveraging both search methods.\n\n\nCleaning company names and constructing search queries using both cleaned names and telephone numbers seems necessary. The search results will then be parsed to extract potential company information by checking addresses, CEOs, telephone numbers, and names against the target data. A scoring system will determine strong matches based on multiple criteria including a \"Busan\" address and any name, tel, or CEO matches. Data will be recorded if the match is strong.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import json\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nimport re\nimport time\nimport os\n\nHEADERS = {\n    \"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\"\n}\n\ndef clean_company_name(name):\n    clean = re.sub(r'\\(주\\)|주식회사|\\(유\\)|\\(사\\)|\\(재\\)|\\(합\\)|\\(주식회사\\)', '', name).strip()\n    return clean\n\ndef search_bizno_query(query):\n    if not query or len(query.strip()) < 2:\n        return []\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/?query={urllib.parse.quote(query.strip())}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=8) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            # Extract unique article IDs\n            links = re.findall(r'/article/(\\d{10})', html)\n            # preserve order, unique\n            seen = set()\n            res = []\n            for l in links:\n                if l not in seen:\n                    seen.add(l)\n                    res.append(l)\n            return res\n    except Exception as e:\n        return []\n\ndef get_bizno_detail(biz_no_10):\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/article/{biz_no_10}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=HEADERS)\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=8) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            \n            desc_match = re.search(r'<meta\\s+name=[\"\\']description[\"\\']\\s+content=[\"\\'](.*?)[\"\\']', html)\n            desc = desc_match.group(1) if desc_match else \"\"\n            \n            title_match = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', html)\n            title = title_match.group(1).replace(\"- 비즈노\", \"\").strip() if title_match else \"\"\n            \n            ceo_match = re.search(r'대표자명\\s*:\\s*([^\\s<]+)', desc)\n            ceo = ceo_match.group(1).strip() if ceo_match else \"\"\n            \n            est_match = re.search(r'설립일[^\\:]*:\\s*(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})', desc)\n            est_year = int(est_match.group(1)) if est_match else \"\"\n            est_month = int(est_match.group(2)) if est_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 종업원수 (종사자수)\n            emp_match = re.search(r'종업원수\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)명', desc)\n            emp_cnt = int(emp_match.group(1)) if emp_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 사업자등록번호\n            biz_match = re.search(r'사업자등록번호\\s*:\\s*(\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5})', desc)\n            biz_no = biz_match.group(1) if biz_match else f\"{biz_no_10[:3]}-{biz_no_10[3:5]}-{biz_no_10[5:]}\"\n            \n            # 전화번호\n            tel_match = re.search(r'전화번호\\s*:\\s*([0-9\\-]+)', desc)\n            tel = tel_match.group(1).strip() if tel_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 팩스번호\n            fax_match = re.search(r'팩스번호\\s*:\\s*([0-9\\-]+)', desc)\n            fax = fax_match.group(1).strip() if fax_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 주소\n            addr_match = re.search(r'회사주소\\s*:\\s*(.*?)(?=\\s+(?:종업원수|사업자등록번호|법인등록번호|홈페이지|통신판매업번호|$))', desc)\n            if not addr_match:\n                addr_match = re.search(r'소재지\\s*</th>\\s*<td[^>]*>(.*?)</td>', html)\n            addr = addr_match.group(1).strip() if addr_match else \"\"\n            addr = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', addr).strip()\n            \n            # 상태\n            status_match = re.search(r'사업자 현재 상태[^\\:]*:\\s*([^\\s<]+)', desc)\n            status = status_match.group(1) if status_match else \"\"\n            \n            # 폐업일자\n            closed_match = re.search(r'폐업일자\\s*:\\s*(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})', html) or re.search(r'폐업일자\\s*:\\s*(\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2})', desc)\n            closed_date = closed_match.group(1) if closed_match else \"\"\n            \n            return {\n                \"biz_no_10\": biz_no_10,\n                \"biz_no\": biz_no,\n                \"title\": title,\n                \"ceo\": ceo,\n                \"est_year\": est_year,\n                \"est_month\": est_month,\n                \"emp_cnt\": emp_cnt,\n                \"tel\": tel,\n                \"fax\": fax,\n                \"addr\": addr,\n                \"status\": status,\n                \"closed_date\": closed_date\n            }\n    except Exception as e:\n        return None\n\ndef score_match(target, cand):\n    # Evaluate if candidate matches target\n    score = 0\n    t_name = clean_company_name(target['name']).lower()\n    c_name = clean_company_name(cand['title']).lower()\n    \n    # Check Busan region\n    is_busan = \"부산\" in cand.get('addr', '') or cand['biz_no_10'].startswith(('602', '603', '604', '605', '606', '607', '608', '609', '617', '618', '243', '421', '182'))\n    \n    # 1. Exact name match\n    if t_name == c_name:\n        score += 40\n    elif t_name in c_name or c_name in t_name:\n        score += 20\n        \n    # 2. Busan match\n    if is_busan:\n        score += 25\n    else:\n        # Non-busan penalty\n        score -= 50\n        \n    # 3. Sigungu match\n    t_sigungu = target.get('sigungu', '')\n    if t_sigungu and t_sigungu in cand.get('addr', ''):\n        score += 20\n        \n    # 4. Tel match\n    t_tel = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', target.get('tel', ''))\n    c_tel = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', cand.get('tel', ''))\n    if t_tel and c_tel and (t_tel == c_tel or t_tel.endswith(c_tel) or c_tel.endswith(t_tel)):\n        score += 35\n        \n    # 5. CEO match\n    t_ceo = target.get('ceo', '').strip()\n    c_ceo = cand.get('ceo', '').strip()\n    if t_ceo and c_ceo and (t_ceo == c_ceo or t_ceo in c_ceo or c_ceo in t_ceo):\n        score += 30\n        \n    return score\n\ndef process_target_batch(start_idx, end_idx):\n    target_file = r\"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\target_318_companies.json\"\n    with open(target_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        targets = json.load(f)\n        \n    progress_file = r\"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\matching_progress.json\"\n    progress = {}\n    if os.path.exists(progress_file):\n        try:\n            with open(progress_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                progress = json.load(f)\n        except:\n            progress = {}\n            \n    batch = targets[start_idx:end_idx]\n    print(f\"Processing batch: index {start_idx} to {end_idx} (Count: {len(batch)})\")\n    \n    for i, t in enumerate(batch):\n        row_key = str(t['row'])\n        if row_key in progress and progress[row_key].get('status') == 'matched':\n            continue\n            \n        print(f\"[{start_idx + i + 1}/{len(targets)}] Checking Row {t['row']}: {t['name']} | Tel: {t['tel']} | Addr: {t['addr']}\")\n        \n        # Search candidate IDs\n        candidate_ids = []\n        # 1. Clean name\n        c_name = clean_company_name(t['name'])\n        if c_name:\n            candidate_ids.extend(search_bizno_query(c_name))\n        # 2. Original name if different\n        if t['name'] != c_name:\n            for cid in search_bizno_query(t['name']):\n                if cid not in candidate_ids: candidate_ids.append(cid)\n        # 3. Clean tel if exists\n        clean_tel = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', t.get('tel', ''))\n        if clean_tel and len(clean_tel) >= 7:\n            for cid in search_bizno_query(clean_tel):\n                if cid not in candidate_ids: candidate_ids.append(cid)\n                \n        # Now score top candidates (check up to first 5)\n        best_cand = None\n        best_score = 0\n        \n        for cid in candidate_ids[:6]:\n            cand = get_bizno_detail(cid)\n            if not cand:\n                continue\n            s = score_match(t, cand)\n            if s > best_score:\n                best_score = s\n                best_cand = cand\n            time.sleep(0.3)\n            \n        if best_cand and best_score >= 50:\n            print(f\"  --> MATCHED (score={best_score}): {best_cand['title']} ({best_cand['biz_no']}), Emp: {best_cand['emp_cnt']}, CEO: {best_cand['ceo']}, Status: {best_cand['status']}\")\n            progress[row_key] = {\n                \"row\": t['row'],\n                \"name\": t['name'],\n                \"status\": \"matched\",\n                \"score\": best_score,\n                \"biz_no\": best_cand['biz_no'],\n                \"emp_cnt\": best_cand['emp_cnt'], # Fixed from Bizno\n                \"ceo\": best_cand['ceo'] if best_cand['ceo'] else t.get('ceo', ''),\n                \"est_year\": best_cand['est_year'] if best_cand['est_year'] else t.get('est_year', ''),\n                \"est_month\": best_cand['est_month'] if best_cand['est_month'] else t.get('est_month', ''),\n                \"tel\": best_cand['tel'] if best_cand['tel'] else t.get('tel', ''),\n                \"fax\": best_cand['fax'] if best_cand['fax'] else t.get('fax', ''),\n                \"addr\": best_cand['addr'] if best_cand['addr'] else t.get('addr', ''),\n                \"cand_status\": best_cand['status'],\n                \"closed_date\": best_cand['closed_date'],\n                \"source\": \"bizno\"\n            }\n        else:\n            print(f\"  --> NO BIZNO MATCH (best_score={best_score}, cands={len(candidate_ids)})\")\n            progress[row_key] = {\n                \"row\": t['row'],\n                \"name\": t['name'],\n                \"status\": \"unmatched_bizno\",\n                \"score\": best_score,\n                \"candidate_count\": len(candidate_ids)\n            }\n            \n        # Save every item\n        with open(progress_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(progress, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n            \n        time.sleep(0.5)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    s = int(sys.argv[1]) if len(sys.argv) > 1 else 0\n    e = int(sys.argv[2]) if len(sys.argv) > 2 else 50\n    process_target_batch(s, e)\n","Description":"Batch matcher script for bizno","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f\\scratch\\batch_matcher.py","toolAction":"Writing batch matcher","toolSummary":"Write batch_matcher.py"}}]}
